// Article 2. Revocation and amendment.
#require "3-incapacity.charter".
Power revoke Actor settlor
  Holds when in-force
  Valid when !deceased(Margaret) && !incapacitated
  Terminates in-force
Power name-successor Actor settlor Related to person
  Valid when !deceased(Margaret) && !incapacitated
  Creates successor(person)

Clause 2.1 => revoke, name-successor
Clause 2.2 => death, revoke, name-successor.
